    "id": "doc_1794398039733_p78a9",
    "title": "ZYNTHEOR Architecture Manifest & 33.7M Parameter Model Specification",
    "content": "# ZYNTHEOR Q+ Sovereign AI Architecture Manifest\n\n## 1. Core Model Topology\nZYNTHEOR runs a 10-layer decoder-only Transformer with 8 Multi-Head Attention heads (d_k=64, d_model=512) and SwiGLU intermediate feed-forward dimension (d_ffn=1,472).\nTotal parameter count is 33,958,400 Float32 parameters (~135.8 MB).\n\n## 2. Invariants & Fail-Closed Standard\n- Absolute Zero External AI APIs: No third-party network egress in the reasoning loop.\n- Cryptographic Integrity: Every block sealed in append-only SHA-256 chained audit ledger.\n- Fail-Closed: Missing or corrupted model checkpoints trigger immediate safe halting.\n- Memory Isolation: Episodic memory persisted separately from static model weights.",
    "source": "docs/architecture_manifest.md",
    "format": "markdown",
    "collection": "Architecture",
    "tags": [
      "architecture",
      "transformer",
      "rope",
      "swiglu",
      "sovereign"
    ],
    "language": "mixed",
    "version": 1,
    "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:53:59.733Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T11:53:59.733Z",
    "contentHash": "57d6764dd5694bd1613982e2e98e38babf0a4a413b3a1ce3164e33e0402ff95a",
    "status": "indexed",
    "chunksCount": 2,
